{"id":"npc:%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"迎击海浪的骑士，曾是骑士小说《最后的骑士》中家喻户晓的主角。在第二次大静谧平行线中被伊莎玛拉击败。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情SN-5 灯塔控制室、SN-ST-8 指挥大厅、SN-ST-12 格兰法洛等，集成战略剧情静谧时代。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_448_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_448_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_448_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_04_end","lineCount":18,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":325,"line":326,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":432,"line":433,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"事物，不应，保持原样。大树，扎根于大地。"},{"commandIndex":565,"line":566,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_05_beg","lineCount":17,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":236,"line":237,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":349,"line":350,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……骑士……同胞。为什么，你要咀嚼空气，你要感受温度，你从不享用，文明的果实。"},{"commandIndex":425,"line":426,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"（不清晰的发音）追！"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st08","lineCount":12,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":246,"line":247,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……唔。"},{"commandIndex":471,"line":472,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……钥匙……我……小麦的气息……家园？家园支援我。家人支援我。"},{"commandIndex":473,"line":474,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"直到我，粉碎大海。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st10","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":60,"line":61,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"（尖啸）群星……墓地……"},{"commandIndex":457,"line":458,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"（沙哑的呢喃）罗辛——南特——"},{"commandIndex":466,"line":467,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"巨浪将至，我们等待，我们去外面等待，武器，撕扯——我们走！"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st11","lineCount":6,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":760,"line":761,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":766,"line":767,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"风暴在撕裂天空。巨浪，将要，来临。"},{"commandIndex":771,"line":772,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"我们迎接巨浪。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_10_beg","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":439,"line":440,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"同类，聚集。驮起方盒，远去。"},{"commandIndex":441,"line":442,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"跟上……我们跟上。我们找到暴风的尽头。"},{"commandIndex":447,"line":448,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"寂静，将临。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st12","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":566,"line":567,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"……罗辛南特……"},{"commandIndex":590,"line":591,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"我不允许，海，再有丁点涟漪！"},{"commandIndex":592,"line":593,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"去吧！"}]},{"story":"activities/act34side/level_act34side_07_end","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":486,"line":487,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"——！"},{"commandIndex":495,"line":496,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"颠倒意义。旷野，山川，小麦地，陆地只是陆地。"},{"commandIndex":506,"line":507,"speaker":"最后的骑士","text":"（愤怒的咆哮）————！"}]}]}